          "text": "BUNDLE_START\n{\"path\":\"about.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>About — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"About {{THERAPIST_NAME}} — a private practice offering grounded, trauma-informed therapy in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}.\\\"> \\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg:#0b0b0b;--muted:#9aa0a6;--accent:#f5d8b6;--panel:#111111;--white:#fff}\\n    html,body{height:100%}\\n    body{margin:0;font-family:Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#050505, #0b0b0b);color:var(--white);line-height:1.45}\\n    .wrap{max-width:980px;margin:48px auto;padding:32px}\\n    nav{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:28px}\\n    .brand{font-weight:700;font-size:20px;letter-spacing:0.06em}\\n    .navlinks a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;margin-left:18px;font-size:14px}\\n    header.hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 320px;gap:28px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:40px}\\n    .hero h1{font-family:Georgia, serif;font-size:38px;margin:0 0 8px;color:var(--white)}\\n    .hero p.lead{color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 20px}\\n    .cta{display:inline-block;padding:12px 18px;background:var(--accent);color:#111;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600}\\n    .card{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);padding:20px;border-radius:10px}\\n    .meta{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:12px}\\n    .section{margin:34px 0}\\n    h2{font-size:20px;margin:0 0 12px}\\n    ul{margin:0;padding-left:18px}\\n    footer{margin-top:44px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}\\n    .avatar{display:flex;align-items:center}\\n    .avatar svg{width:88px;height:88px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#111,#1b1b1b);padding:12px}\\n    .small{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted)}\\n    .pill{display:inline-block;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);padding:6px 10px;border-radius:999px;font-size:13px;margin-right:8px}\\n    .subtle{color:var(--muted)}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <nav>\\n      <div class=\\\"brand\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n      <div class=\\\"navlinks\\\">\\n        <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Home</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"about.html\\\">About</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"specialties.html\\\">Paths</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"approach.html\\\">Approach</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"fees.html\\\">Fees</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"book.html\\\">Book</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"contact.html\\\">Contact</a>\\n      </div>\\n    </nav>\\n\\n    <header class=\\\"hero\\\">\\n      <div>\\n        <h1>Holding space for change — gentle, direct therapy</h1>\\n        <p class=\\\"lead\\\">I combine attuned listening with evidence-informed modalities to help you move through anxiety, life transitions, and the wounds that repeat. Therapy is a collaborative practice — we map what matters and take practical steps toward more agency.</p>\\n        <a class=\\\"cta\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"section\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:22px\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"avatar\\\">\\n              <!-- unique avatar svg for about.html -->\\n              <svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 120 120\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n                <defs>\\n                  <linearGradient id=\\\"gA\\\" x1=\\\"0\\\" x2=\\\"1\\\">\\n                    <stop offset=\\\"0\\\" stop-color=\\\"#f7e7d0\\\" />\\n                    <stop offset=\\\"1\\\" stop-color=\\\"#f5d8b6\\\" />\\n                  </linearGradient>\\n                </defs>\\n                <rect width=\\\"120\\\" height=\\\"120\\\" rx=\\\"16\\\" fill=\\\"#0f0f0f\\\" />\\n                <circle cx=\\\"60\\\" cy=\\\"42\\\" r=\\\"20\\\" fill=\\\"url(#gA)\\\" opacity=\\\"0.98\\\" />\\n                <path d=\\\"M30 94c6-14 30-16 60-4\\\" stroke=\\\"#f5d8b6\\\" stroke-width=\\\"3\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" />\\n                <rect x=\\\"12\\\" y=\\\"12\\\" width=\\\"96\\\" height=\\\"96\\\" rx=\\\"12\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"#111\\\" />\\n              </svg>\\n              <div style=\\\"margin-left:12px\\\">\\n                <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">{{THERAPIST_NAME}}, {{LICENSE}}</div>\\n                <div class=\\\"small\\\">{{MODALITIES}} — {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"meta\\\">Sessions online and in-person. Sliding scale availability discussed at intake.</div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div>\\n        <!-- editorial hero ornament unique to about.html -->\\n        <svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 360 360\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" style=\\\"width:100%;height:auto;display:block\\\">\\n          <defs>\\n            <linearGradient id=\\\"hA\\\" x1=\\\"0\\\" x2=\\\"1\\\">\\n              <stop offset=\\\"0\\\" stop-color=\\\"#f5d8b6\\\" />\\n              <stop offset=\\\"1\\\" stop-color=\\\"#e8c7a2\\\" />\\n            </linearGradient>\\n          </defs>\\n          <rect width=\\\"360\\\" height=\\\"360\\\" rx=\\\"24\\\" fill=\\\"#0a0a0a\\\" />\\n          <g transform=\\\"translate(18,18)\\\">\\n            <path d=\\\"M40 260c40-80 160-80 220-20\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"url(#hA)\\\" stroke-width=\\\"22\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" opacity=\\\"0.95\\\" />\\n            <circle cx=\\\"120\\\" cy=\\\"120\\\" r=\\\"58\\\" fill=\\\"#111\\\" stroke=\\\"#1f1f1f\\\" />\\n            <ellipse cx=\\\"120\\\" cy=\\\"120\\\" rx=\\\"34\\\" ry=\\\"50\\\" fill=\\\"url(#hA)\\\" opacity=\\\"0.92\\\" />\\n          </g>\\n        </svg>\\n      </div>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <main>\\n      <section class=\\\"section\\\">\\n        <h2>Clinical compass: how I begin</h2>\\n        <p class=\\\"subtle\\\">An initial conversation maps current struggles, support systems, and safety. I listen for patterns — what keeps recurring, what makes you soften — and we co-create a short-term focus. This is not a one-size-fits-all intake; it is a practical planning conversation.</p>\\n        <ul>\\n          <li>18–50 minute intake that balances history with present concerns</li>\\n          <li>Shared goal-setting for 6–12 weeks of work</li>\\n          <li>Confidentiality & privacy discussed; limits to confidentiality explained</li>\\n        </ul>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <section class=\\\"section\\\">\\n        <h2>Therapeutic offerings & structure</h2>\\n        <p class=\\\"subtle\\\">My work is integrative and trauma-informed. Interventions are chosen to fit the person: somatic grounding, cognitive reframing, attachment-focused inquiry, and skills for emotion regulation.</p>\\n        <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:14px;flex-wrap:wrap\\\">\\n          <span class=\\\"pill\\\">Short-term Insight</span>\\n          <span class=\\\"pill\\\">Stabilization Support</span>\\n          <span class=\\\"pill\\\">Relationship Work</span>\\n          <span class=\\\"pill\\\">Life-Transition Guidance</span>\\n        </div>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <section class=\\\"section\\\">\\n        <h2>Small practices that help between sessions</h2>\\n        <p class=\\\"subtle\\\">Change happens in the in-betweens. Below are micro-habits I often offer; they are simple, optional practices to support regulation and awareness.</p>\\n        <ul>\\n          <li>3-minute grounding: feet on floor, inhale 4 — exhale 6 x5</li>\\n          <li>Evening noting: write one line about what felt true today</li>\\n          <li>Curiosity pause: when reactive, ask \\\"What am I fearing right now?\\\" before reacting</li>\\n        </ul>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <section class=\\\"section\\\">\\n        <h2>Investment & options</h2>\\n        <p class=\\\"subtle\\\">I offer a tiered structure so care can meet you where you are. Please ask about sliding scale availability.</p>\\n        <ul>\\n          <li><strong>Compass Sessions</strong> — single 50-minute sessions for assessment and strategy. (Good for short-term planning.)</li>\\n          <li><strong>Pathway Package</strong> — recommended 8–12 sessions: structured work on a focused goal.</li>\\n          <li><strong>Open Care</strong> — ongoing weekly sessions for relational or complex trauma work.</li>\\n        </ul>\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\"><a class=\\\"cta\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a></div>\\n      </section>\\n\\n    </main>\\n\\n    <footer>\\n      <div class=\\\"section card\\\">\\n        <strong>Practical notes</strong>\\n        <div class=\\\"small\\\">Email: <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a> • Phone: <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none\\\">{{PHONE}}</a></div>\\n        <p class=\\\"small\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">Confidentiality: Sessions are confidential except in legally defined situations (safety concerns, court orders). If you are in crisis or at immediate risk, please call emergency services or your local crisis line. Therapy does not guarantee specific outcomes. Scope: I provide outpatient psychotherapy and consultation; I do not provide emergency services.</p>\\n        <p class=\\\"small\\\">{{THERAPIST_NAME}}, {{LICENSE}} • {{MODALITIES}}</p>\\n      </div>\\n    </footer>\\n  </div>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"specialties.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>Specialties — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Clinical specialties offered by {{THERAPIST_NAME}}: anxiety, trauma recovery, relationship challenges, burnout, and transitions in {{CITY}}.\\\" />\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg:#fff;--ink:#0b0b0b;--muted:#555;--accent:#2b6cb0}\\n    body{margin:0;font-family:Inter, Arial, sans-serif;background:#fff;color:var(--ink)}\\n    .container{max-width:1000px;margin:48px auto;padding:28px}\\n    header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}\\n    .logo{font-weight:700}\\n    nav a{margin-left:14px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}\\n    .hero{margin-top:28px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 260px;gap:28px;align-items:start}\\n    .hero h1{font-family:Georgia, serif;font-size:34px;margin:0;color:var(--ink)}\\n    .lead{color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px}\\n    .box{background:#f7fbff;border:1px solid #e8f1fb;padding:18px;border-radius:10px}\\n    .spec-list{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:16px;margin-top:18px}\\n    .spec{background:#fff;padding:14px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #eef6ff}\\n    h3{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:16px}\\n    .small{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted)}\\n    .cta{display:inline-block;margin-top:12px;padding:10px 14px;background:var(--accent);color:white;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class=\\\"container\\\">\\n    <header>\\n      <div class=\\\"logo\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n      <nav>\\n        <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Welcome</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"about.html\\\">Who I Am</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"specialties.html\\\">Specialties</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"approach.html\\\">Work With Me</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"fees.html\\\">Investment</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"contact.html\\\">Reach Out</a>\\n      </nav>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <div class=\\\"hero\\\">\\n      <div>\\n        <h1>Focused care for the patterns that keep returning</h1>\\n        <p class=\\\"lead\\\">I work with adults facing persistent anxiety, the aftermath of trauma, relationship ruptures, burnout, and pivotal life transitions. Treatment is collaborative and paced to your current capacity.</p>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"section\\\">\\n          <h2 style=\\\"font-size:18px;margin:18px 0 8px\\\">How I assess needs</h2>\\n          <p class=\\\"small\\\">Initial sessions combine structured assessment with narrative — we track symptoms and lived experience. This diagnostic stage informs a clear, time-limited plan we both agree on.</p>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"section\\\">\\n          <h2 style=\\\"font-size:18px;margin:18px 0 8px\\\">What I commonly treat</h2>\\n          <div class=\\\"spec-list\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"spec\\\">\\n              <h3>Anxiety & Worry</h3>\\n              <div class=\\\"small\\\">Tools for panic, persistent worry, and physiological dysregulation using CBT-informed strategies and paced exposure.</div>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"spec\\\">\\n              <h3>Trauma Recovery</h3>\\n              <div class=\\\"small\\\">Stabilization, processing, and integration with somatic and relationally-focused interventions; safety prioritized throughout.</div>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"spec\\\">\\n              <h3>Relationship Strain</h3>\\n              <div class=\\\"small\\\">Communication skill-building, attachment-focused work, and repairing rupture in adult relationships.</div>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"spec\\\">\\n              <h3>Burnout & Transitions</h3>\\n              <div class=\\\"small\\\">Boundary-setting, values clarification, and pacing strategies for career and life transitions.</div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <aside>\\n        <div class=\\\"box\\\">\\n          <h3 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px\\\">Programs (framing)</h3>\\n          <p class=\\\"small\\\">I describe my offerings as pathways rather than packages. Choose what fits your need: a focused consultation, a short therapeutic pathway for specific changes, or ongoing relational work.</p>\\n          <a class=\\\"cta\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">{‌{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:18px\\\" class=\\\"box\\\">\\n          <h3 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px\\\">Typical session</h3>\\n          <div class=\\\"small\\\">50 minutes, regular review of goals, optional between-session practices. Confidential, non-judgmental, and grounded in clinical ethics.</div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <!-- unique pattern svg for specialties.html -->\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:18px;text-align:center\\\">\\n          <svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 160 160\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" style=\\\"width:100%;height:auto\\\">\\n            <rect width=\\\"160\\\" height=\\\"160\\\" rx=\\\"14\\\" fill=\\\"#f7fbff\\\" />\\n            <g fill-opacity=\\\"0.9\\\" fill=\\\"#dbeefc\\\">\\n              <circle cx=\\\"40\\\" cy=\\\"40\\\" r=\\\"22\\\" />\\n              <circle cx=\\\"120\\\" cy=\\\"60\\\" r=\\\"18\\\" />\\n              <circle cx=\\\"80\\\" cy=\\\"110\\\" r=\\\"26\\\" />\\n            </g>\\n          </svg>\\n        </div>\\n      </aside>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:36px\\\">\\n      <h2 style=\\\"font-size:18px\\\">Practical supports I teach</h2>\\n      <p class=\\\"small\\\">Clients often ask for concrete practices. Below are examples integrated into therapy when appropriate:</p>\\n      <ul>\\n        <li>Grounding & breath regulation for panic and overwhelm</li>\\n        <li>Boundaries practice scripts for stressful interactions</li>\\n        <li>Self-compassion exercises to work with shame or perfectionism</li>\\n      </ul>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:26px\\\" class=\\\"box\\\">\\n      <h2 style=\\\"font-size:18px\\\">Values & limits</h2>\\n      <p class=\\\"small\\\">I maintain clear boundaries around session structure and confidentiality. If there are legal, safety, or medical concerns, I will discuss limits to confidentiality and coordinate care with your consent where needed.</p>\\n      <p class=\\\"small\\\">If you are in crisis, please contact local emergency services or your crisis line; I do not provide emergency response.</p>\\n      <p class=\\\"small\\\">Licensed: {{THERAPIST_NAME}}, {{LICENSE}} • {{MODALITIES}}</p>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <footer style=\\\"margin-top:28px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px\\\">\\n      <div>Contact: <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a> • {{PHONE}}</div>\\n      <div style=\\\"margin-top:6px\\\">Practice location: {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} — Telehealth available where permitted.</div>\\n    </footer>\\n  </div>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"approach.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>Approach & Methods — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Therapeutic approach of {{THERAPIST_NAME}} — integrative, trauma-aware, and skill-focused. Learn about process, micro-practices, and program options.\\\">\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg:#070707;--ink:#fff;--muted:#9ea3a8;--gold:#e9c9a3}\\n    body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font-family:Georgia, serif}\\n    .container{max-width:980px;margin:48px auto;padding:28px}\\n    nav{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}\\n    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;margin-left:14px}\\n    .mast{display:flex;gap:28px;align-items:flex-start}\\n    .left{flex:1}\\n    .right{width:320px}\\n    h1{font-size:34px;margin:0 0 10px}\\n    p.lead{color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 18px}\\n    .panel{background:#0f0f0f;padding:18px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03)}\\n    .method-list{margin-top:14px}\\n    .method{margin-bottom:16px}\\n    .micro{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap}\\n    .micro .chip{background:rgba(233,201,163,0.12);color:var(--gold);padding:8px 10px;border-radius:999px;font-size:13px}\\n    .cta{display:inline-block;margin-top:12px;padding:10px 14px;background:var(--gold);color:#000;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}\\n    footer{margin-top:30px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class=\\\"container\\\">\\n    <nav>\\n      <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n      <div>\\n        <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Home</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"about.html\\\">About</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"specialties.html\\\">Specialties</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"approach.html\\\">Approach</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"fees.html\\\">Fees</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"book.html\\\">Book</a>\\n      </div>\\n    </nav>\\n\\n    <div class=\\\"mast\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:26px\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"left\\\">\\n        <h1>My clinical stance: curiosity + structure</h1>\\n        <p class=\\\"lead\\\">Therapy is exploratory and practical. I combine empathic, culturally aware listening with structured interventions so you feel both seen and supported toward change.</p>\\n\\n        <section class=\\\"panel\\\">\\n          <h2 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px;font-size:18px\\\">Assessment & diagnostic frame</h2>\\n          <p class=\\\"small\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">Early work is about safety and specificity. I assess current symptom patterns, relational context, and resources. Together we form a working diagnosis that guides treatment choices without defining you.</p>\\n        </section>\\n\\n        <section style=\\\"margin-top:18px\\\">\\n          <h2 style=\\\"font-size:18px;margin:0 0 10px\\\">Therapeutic methods I draw from</h2>\\n          <div class=\\\"method-list\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"method\\\"><strong>Somatic-informed Regulation</strong> — grounding, orientation, and body-based resources to reduce reactivity.</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"method\\\"><strong>Cognitive & Behavioral tools</strong> — practical skills for shifting unhelpful patterns of thought and action.</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"method\\\"><strong>Attachment & Relational Repair</strong> — working with patterns that unfold in important relationships.</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"method\\\"><strong>Mindful Integration</strong> — cultivating presence and compassionate noticing for difficult emotions.</div>\\n          </div>\\n        </section>\\n\\n        <section style=\\\"margin-top:18px\\\">\\n          <h2 style=\\\"font-size:18px;margin:0 0 10px\\\">Programs & investment (framed differently)</h2>\\n          <p class=\\\"small\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">Below are program frames to help you choose. These are conversational starting points, not rigid packages.</p>\\n          <ul>\\n            <li><strong>Orientation Session</strong> — single session to assess fit and immediate priorities.</li>\\n            <li><strong>Stabilize & Skill</strong> — 6–10 sessions focused on symptom reduction and self-regulation skills.</li>\\n            <li><strong>Deep Integration</strong> — ongoing weekly work for complex trauma, relational patterns, or long-term growth.</li>\\n          </ul>\\n        </section>\\n\\n        <section style=\\\"margin-top:18px\\\">\\n          <h2 style=\\\"font-size:18px;margin:0 0 10px\\\">Daily practices I suggest</h2>\\n          <div class=\\\"micro\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"chip\\\">2-minute breath anchor</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"chip\\\">Evening strengths note</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"chip\\\">Conflict script rehearsal</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"chip\\\">Grounding object technique</div>\\n          </div>\\n          <p class=\\\"small\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:10px;color:var(--muted)\\\">These micro-habits are optional and tailored to your preferences and safety. We select a few that actually feel doable in your life.</p>\\n        </section>\\n\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <aside class=\\\"right\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"panel\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom:18px\\\">\\n          <h3 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px\\\">Intake flow</h3>\\n          <ol style=\\\"color:var(--muted);padding-left:18px;margin:0\\\">\\n            <li>Brief phone or email consult</li>\\n            <li>Intake session to clarify goals</li>\\n            <li>Short-term plan with measurable steps</li>\\n          </ol>\\n          <a class=\\\"cta\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <!-- unique hero svg for approach.html -->\\n        <div style=\\\"text-align:center\\\">\\n          <svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 220 220\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" style=\\\"width:100%;height:auto\\\">\\n            <rect width=\\\"220\\\" height=\\\"220\\\" rx=\\\"20\\\" fill=\\\"#0b0b0b\\\" />\\n            <g transform=\\\"translate(18,18)\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"#e9c9a3\\\" stroke-width=\\\"6\\\">\\n              <path d=\\\"M20 160c40-80 120-80 160-40\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" />\\n              <path d=\\\"M40 40c30 18 70 12 110 36\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" opacity=\\\"0.9\\\" />\\n            </g>\\n          </svg>\\n        </div>\\n\\n      </aside>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:26px\\\">\\n      <h2 style=\\\"font-size:18px;margin:0 0 8px\\\">Ethical notes & limits of practice</h2>\\n      <p class=\\\"small\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">I follow standards for confidentiality and informed consent. Therapy is not a substitute for emergency medical care. If you are an immediate danger to yourself or others, please call local emergency services. I will discuss limits to confidentiality in the first sessions. Referrals will be made when needs fall outside my scope.</p>\\n      <p class=\\\"small\\\">Licensed: {{THERAPIST_NAME}}, {{LICENSE}} • Modalities: {{MODALITIES}} • Location: {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</p>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <footer>\\n      <div class=\\\"small\\\">Contact: <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a> • {{PHONE}}</div>\\n    </footer>\\n\\n  </div>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \nBUNDLE_END"
